/Title (Long, pointed beaks access cactus flowers and nectar. Medium pointed beaks probe for insects and mixed food. Specialized tool-like beaks extract insects from wood. Each shape is a precise adaptation to its environment \(Abzhanov, 2010; Clark et al., 2020\).)
